  "reason": "R1.4 adds lspk-wavetable's shaper benchmarks, one per mode family (32 voices across lanes, and one voice scalar with audio-rate amount modulation; the phase modes and distortions render 4x oversampled). The oscillator's own benchmarks move by -2.2 % to +3.5 %: its kernel now asks the phase stage for its slope once per lane and stretch, and sums a stage's reads, which the plain oscillator's stages answer trivially. The lspk-wavetable counts come from CI on the branch; every other count is main's (R1.18 and R1.19 included).",
